      "patch_payload": {
        "candidate_id": "C_511cbaddc21f372e_2",
        "edit": "Swap the enable polarity: decode when ena is high (case inside if(ena)) and force y=0 when ena is low, matching the oracle where cycle0 with ena=0 expects 00000000 and cycle1 with ena=1 expects 00000001.",
